1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,993
WhatToEat is an app that literally helps you decide what to eat in under a minute.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:09,255
Setting up takes one sentence. Just tell it your food preferences.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:17,120
“I'm vegetarian. I'm a big fan of dosas and chaat, I love spicy food, I have no allergies, and I prefer healthy options.”

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:26,021
It transcribes as you speak, then works out what you meant: dosas and chaat become South Indian and street food.

5
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:33,824
Home changes with the time of day, with quick picks, trending dishes, chef recipes and popular restaurants.

6
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:39,149
It helps with all three: cooking at home, ordering in, and dining out.

7
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,547
Cooking tonight? Just say what's in the kitchen.

8
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:48,300
“I've got paneer, capsicum and onions at home. I want to cook something quick and spicy for dinner.”

9
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:55,600
One sentence answered all five questions. Every pick is vegetarian, like the profile.

10
00:00:56,200 --> 00:01:01,235
The recipe is written on the spot, around the ingredients you actually have.

11
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:06,467
You can also log your meals, and it will save them to your daily log.

12
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:11,408
Had a heavy day? It gently nudges you toward a light dinner.

13
00:01:13,460 --> 00:01:17,623
Eating out instead? Typing works just as well.

14
00:01:19,100 --> 00:01:23,452
It asks only what it still needs: flavour, then the vibe.

15
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:30,688
For a night out, you get places to go, not calories to count, each with a suggested order.

16
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:36,973
The menu keeps to vegetarian dishes, with prices, and a link to find the place on Google Maps.

17
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:40,131
Staying in? Ask for delivery the same way.

18
00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:46,820
Each pick shows its calories, and Order on Swiggy opens the dish, ready to order.

19
00:01:47,570 --> 00:01:51,581
And Community has recipes other people love, filtered to your diet.

20
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:58,859
Cook, order in, or dine out. WhatToEat: decide what to eat in under a minute.
